  s0210: ["They all addressed themselves as \"I, the unworthy one.\"","They all addressed themselves as \"I, the unworthy one.\""],
  s0211: ["Below the Chancellor, all official documents and reports were submitted to the Director of Documents.","Below the Chancellor, all official documents and reports were submitted to the Director of Documents, as recorded here."],
  s0212: ["When the heir governed the state, his documents and memorials followed the forms of a minister but did not call himself minister.","Upon the heir governed the state, his documents and memorials followed the forms of a minister but did not call himself minister."],
  s0213: ["Documents issued to subordinate officials all said \"Proclamation.\"","Documents issued to subordinate officials all said \"Proclamation.\""],
  s0214: ["All officials of princely, ducal, and marquis states called themselves ministers.","All officials of princely, ducal, and marquis states called themselves ministers, as recorded here."],
  s0215: ["When appearing at the imperial court, all called themselves accompanying ministers.","Upon appearing at the imperial court, all called themselves accompanying ministers."],
  s0216: ["When making representations, all said \"Submitting a memorial.\"","Upon making representations, all said \"Submitting a memorial.\""],
  s0217: ["Their official documents said \"Reporting an affair.\"","Their official documents said \"Reporting an affair.\""],
