  s0271: ["The twenty-three provinces were all ranked high and low; selections were made with reference to inner offices.","The twenty-three provinces were all ranked high and low; selections were made with reference to inner offices, as recorded here."],
  s0272: ["Grand Administrators and Assistant Directors of commanderies: ten classes each.","Grand Administrators and Assistant Directors of commanderies—ten classes each."],
  s0273: ["Counties were fixed at seven classes.","Counties were fixed at seven classes, as recorded here."],
  s0274: ["Appointments at each level were modeled on inner offices.","Appointments at each level were modeled on inner offices, as recorded here."],
  s0275: ["An edict also held that the names of generals were confused in high and low rank, and ordered further clarification.","An edict also held that the names of generals were confused in high and low rank, and ordered further clarification, as recorded here."],
  s0276: ["Thereupon the responsible officials memorialized to establish one hundred twenty-five general titles.","Thereupon the responsible officials memorialized to establish one hundred twenty-five general titles, as recorded here."],
